{
  "id": "759",
  "title": "Open, Close",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-09-21",
  "synopsis": "Ben is being helpful to Teacher Zhang, but where is the on-off button?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1152/cba35946055eca49f37abd4b1aef19e6bf97553e.mp3?1568622530",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "开、关\n\n张老师：现在我们来看一个PPT。本，你能帮我关灯吗？谢谢！\n本：开关在哪儿？\n张老师：在那儿。\n（看完PPT后）\n张老师：好了。本，你能帮我开灯吗？\n本：好的。\n张老师：啊，请再帮我开前门，关后门。\n本：好的。\n张老师：谢谢！",
    "traditional": "開、關\n\n張老師：現在我們來看一個PPT。本，你能幫我關燈嗎？謝謝！\n本：開關在哪兒？\n張老師：在那兒。\n（看完PPT後）\n張老師：好了。本，你能幫我開燈嗎？\n本：好的。\n張老師：啊，請再幫我開前門，關後門。\n本：好的。\n張老師：謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Open, Close"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "张老师：现在我们来看一个PPT。",
      "traditional": "張老師：現在我們來看一個PPT。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī xiàn zài wǒ men lái kàn yí ge 3",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "本，你能帮我关灯吗？谢谢！",
      "traditional": "本，你能幫我關燈嗎？謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ néng bāng wǒ guān dēng ma xiè xie",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Now we will look at a PPT."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben, can you help me turn off the lights? Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "本：开关在哪儿？",
      "traditional": "本：開關在哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "běn kāi guān zài nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Where is the on-off button?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "张老师：在那儿。",
      "traditional": "張老師：在那兒。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī zài nà'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: It’s there."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "（看完PPT后）",
      "traditional": "（看完PPT後）",
      "pinyin": "kàn wán 3 hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(After they finished watching the PPT)"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "张老师：好了。本，你能帮我开灯吗？",
      "traditional": "張老師：好了。本，你能幫我開燈嗎？",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī hǎo le běn nǐ néng bāng wǒ kāi dēng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Ok. Ben, can you help me turn on the lights?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "张老师：啊，请再帮我开前门，关后门。",
      "traditional": "張老師：啊，請再幫我開前門，關後門。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī a qǐng zài bāng wǒ kāi qián mén guān hòu mén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Oh, please also help me open the front door, and close the back door."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "张老师：谢谢！",
      "traditional": "張老師：謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Thank you!"
    }
  ],
